+// How long an unpinned sidebar tab may sit untouched before it is closed
+// (the way back is History or the reopen-closed-tab shortcut).
+//
+// ⚠ The key still says "today_archive" while the UI no longer says "Today"
+// anywhere (user 2026-08-26: with the tier set to Never the tabs are not
+// from today at all). Renaming a pref that is already on disk would
+// silently reset whatever tier the user had chosen, which is worse than an
+// inconsistent key nobody sees.
+//
+// Integer *minutes*; 0 means Never.
+//
+// The value is the tier: appearance_behavior_page.ts writes 720 / 1440 /
+// 4320 / 10080 / 43200 / 0 straight into its menu, so there is no C++ enum
+// to keep in sync and adding a tier later is a data change. The tiers and
+// the default live in workspace_archive_policy.h.
+inline constexpr char kWorkspaceTodayArchiveMinutes[] =
+    "helium.workspace.today_archive_minutes";
